title: "Regression Diagnostics"
subtitle: "Check a fitted model's assumptions, find outliers and influential points, and spot collinearity."
description: "Residual types, residual and Q-Q plots, transformations, leverage, Cook's distance, DFFITS and DFBETAS, and variance inflation factors, with eight simulated plot-reading examples, using mentally unhealthy days in BRFSS 2020."
order: 11
unit: "Linear regression"
categories: [Linear regression]
